msgid ""
"Three actor types can be placed on a `RobotWorld` grid. They are created "
"automatically by `load` / `load_world` / `task` when the `WorldConfig` "
"lists them in `objects`, but you can also place them manually via "
"`world.add_object(Leaf, (col, row))`."
